1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,400
Autumn has come to Seoul.

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,700
And there's one place you have to see.

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,710
Gyeongbokgung. Come with someone you love — your partner, your family.

4
00:00:09,210 --> 00:00:11,870
Walk slow. The leaves are in no hurry.

5
00:00:12,370 --> 00:00:14,320
At night, it's something special.

6
00:00:14,820 --> 00:00:17,080
Another face, painted in light.

7
00:00:17,580 --> 00:00:20,090
Take the photos. Make the memories.

8
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:23,320
Everything else — Korea Street dot com.
